_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 9
---
order: 9
---
short_label: VII.9
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If a number is a part of a number, and another is the same part of another, then alternately, whatever part or parts the first is of the third, the same part, or the same parts, the second is of the fourth.
----
proof:

Let the number {A} be a part of the number {BC}, and another number {D} be the same part of another number {EF} that {A} is of {BC}.

I say that, alternately, {BC} is the same part or parts of {EF} that {A} is of {D}.

